    "items": [
      {
        "name": "Ryan Z.",
        "rating": 5,
        "title": "",
        "content": "I use it when I know I will be on my feet all afternoon. The side stabilizers make it feel more substantial than the basic sleeves I have owned, but it does not feel like a rigid orthopedic brace. The sleeve feels supportive without being rigid.",
        "date": "09/15/2026",
        "verified": false,
        "image": "/assets/images/tv-reviews/1790153927__1790153924210-capturedecran2026-09-23a15__origin.webp"
      },
      {
        "name": "Daniel V.",
        "rating": 5,
        "title": "",
        "content": "I like that the design combines compression with side support instead of relying on a single elastic layer. I wear it around the house when my knee needs extra support.",
        "date": "09/14/2026",
        "verified": false,
        "image": "/assets/images/tv-reviews/1790153946__1790153942576-capturedecran2026-09-23a15__origin.webp"
      },
      {
        "name": "Richard X.",
        "rating": 5,
        "title": "",
        "content": "The non-slip grip is a small detail that I appreciate because constantly repositioning a knee sleeve gets annoying. It is comfortable enough for several hours.",
        "date": "09/13/2026",
        "verified": false,
        "image": "/assets/images/tv-reviews/1790153958__1790153955231-capturedecran2026-09-23a15__origin.webp"
      },
      {
        "name": "Joseph K.",
        "rating": 5,
        "title": "",
        "content": "I bought it for everyday errands rather than sports. I wanted support without feeling like my knee was locked in place. This still lets me move naturally while giving me a more secure feeling. It is less bulky than I expected.",
        "date": "09/09/2026",
